{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地男星肖戰8日於上海舉行《出口·我們》巡迴演唱會，女星李沁、鍾楚曦以及劇集《小城良方》的團隊現身捧場。</p><p>肖戰在台上點名李沁和鍾楚曦，並提及是多年前拍戲時的玩笑約定，李沁在鏡頭捕捉下顯得有些靦覥。</p><p>其後當肖戰演唱《小城良方》的主題曲《輕輕》時，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T16:23:41.658626+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T16:01:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T16:16:58.867716+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T16:16:58.867716+00:00","content_hash":"875d93bd6348bff248ed7130e3f321cfd6b081688bbf5601ad27d2a2c1ba6158","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}